#. module: om_account_cash_forecast
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_om_account_cash_forecast
msgid ""
"\n"
"Cash forecast: starting from the bank and cash balance of today, the receipts and payments expected by week or\n"
"by month from the due dates of the open customer invoices and vendor bills, the payments not yet in the bank,\n"
"the recurring payments and the expected items entered by hand (salaries, rent, loans, taxes...).\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Kasprognose: vanaf het bank- en kassaldo van vandaag, de verwachte ontvangsten en betalingen per week of\n"
"per maand op basis van de vervaldatums van de openstaande klantfacturen en leveranciersfacturen, de betalingen die nog niet op de bank staan,\n"
"de terugkerende betalingen en de handmatig ingevoerde verwachte posten (salarissen, huur, leningen, belastingen...).\n"

